OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSome bright spells in the
OL,6,Fsoutheast this morning, otherwise a
OL,7,Frather cloudy and at times, damp day
OL,8,Fwith mostly light showery rain edging
OL,9,Fsoutheastwards across Wales. A little
OL,10,Fbrighter in the northwest later, but
OL,11,Ffeeling cooler than on Thursday.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRain across the south will
OL,14,Fmove away during the evening, leaving
OL,15,Fa dry and clear night for many. A few
OL,16,Fmist patches. A chilly night to come
OL,17,Faway from coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
