OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA bright start to the
OL,6,Fweekend with sunny spells. The odd
OL,7,Fshower possible in the west with brisk
OL,8,Fwinds at times in the north.
OL,9,FTemperatures a touch above the average.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FTurning
OL,12,Fwindier on Sunday with heavy rain
OL,13,Farriving, clearing later. Sunny
OL,14,Fperiods on Monday before wet and windy
OL,15,Fweather returns on Tuesday.
OL,16,FTemperatures remaining above average,
OL,17,Fwarmest on Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
